					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TEXT\n\nThe written word, the source of modern civilization and an important tool to master in Wire.\nYou'll be amazed at how often you need a little counter, some names or titles.\nText can also be useful for debugging your patches where you create a little debug tool which displays your values on the screen.\n\nSo let's get started and talk about our favorite type of underwear."
					}
				},
