					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "CHANGE CASE\n\nChange Case is the ultimate keyboard-warrior node.\nIt will take a string and convert all characters to UPPERCASE.\nIt can also convert everything to lower case if needed.\n\nIn the example we've created a sentence with terrible casing for demonstration's sake.\nThe Change Case nodes are used to straighten everything out.\n\nAssignment: Create a String In, Change Case and Text Render node and make sure it SCREAMS!\n\n"
					}
